Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The campaign->sim loop closes and the world viewer renders the tasking
picture as the primary end-to-end QC surface:
- f4-campaign: emit_flight_intents() over the world-source interfaces
  (one MissionIntent per tasked flight, real VU_ID.nums, roster 2-bit
  packing, save-absolute TOT) + MissionCategory (41 bytes -> 11
  behavioral categories, pinned).
- f4-world: THE VU_ID FIX — world_state.cpp never parsed id_num/
  id_creator for units or objectives, so every JSON-loaded world built
  EMPTY id maps and all cross-refs (flight->package/squadron,
  battalion->brigade, squadron->airbase) silently no-oped. Now loads
  them, resolves flight mission targets + package elements and the
  ATM mission request, and carries the campaign bullseye.
- f4-simulation: spawn_aircraft_for_flight() as the shared spawn core
  (per-airbase parking offsets, FM initialized AT the parking spot —
  the old (0,0) init teleported every campaign aircraft to the datum
  on tick 1); build_mission_plan_from_flight() (grid waypoints ->
  ENU MissionPlans, leading TAKEOFF dropped, z floored at 500 ft);
  CampaignSimSpawner (bus side of B.3, dedupe + stats + filters);
  initialize() derives the campaign airfield BEFORE wire_atc().
- f4-simulation: GROUND-OPS FIX (the first campaign_qc run: 12/12
  spawned, 0 airborne — all taxiing across the theater at 19 kts).
  Saves embed ground layouts only for Airstrip-class objectives; the
  50 real Airbases decode layout-less, derive_airfield rejected them,
  every TaxiRequest fell back to the default (first derivable) field
  — cross-theater taxi (aircraft 1's 54.2 deg heading matched the
  bearing to the first Airstrip to 0.3 deg). Airfield-class objectives
  without layouts now get a SYNTHETIC local field (7000 ft runway on
  the active runway heading, 2-waypoint taxi route, 8 parking spots;
  real theater layouts win automatically when loaded later), and
  flights based at non-airfield objectives (army aviation) park at
  the fallback airfield. Verified: 12/12 airborne, full
  Taxi->Takeoff->FlyOut->Enroute sequence, 65-116 NM in 5 min.
- f4-simulation: campaign_qc tool — one command over any decoded
  save: B.3 loop stats, a replayable scenario + Simulation run, and
  campaign_qc_summary.json (world stats, mission histogram,
  per-aircraft end state). Exit 3 when nothing gets airborne ("the
  tasking didn't fly" gate). record_every decimation for long runs.
- f4-world-viewer: ATO/Tasking window (sortable, filtered,
  click-to-focus flight table), mission->target + package->element
  link overlays, bullseye crosshair, mission filter shared with the
  canvas, flight/package inspector with clickable cross-refs,
  campaign-clock formatting. WP_ACTION table corrected against
  campwp.h (TAKEOFF/LAND were swapped).
- StubATC: per-airbase airfield registry (airbase_id-keyed requests;
  campaign saves park flights at dozens of fields — one global config
  handed every aircraft the same taxi route, the exact QC catch).
- tests: +21 (1857 -> 1878, 100%): emit_flight_intents, route
  building, spawner loop, scenario filters, synthetic-field
  derivation, army-base parking guard, enum text, world-loader
  cross-ref resolution.
